    .. note:: The `Style <Vcl.ExtCtrls.TCustomColorBox.Style.htm>`__ property controls which colors are included in the list.
    '''
    ColorNames: list[str]
    '''
    Lists the names of the colors in the ``ColorBox``.

    Use ``ColorNames()`` to obtain the name of one of the colors listed in the ``ColorBox``.

    ``Index`` is the index of the name, where 0 is the index of the first color in the box, 1 is the index of the second color, and so on.

    The value of each name is either the name of a color constant defined in the ``Graphics`` unit (such as clBlack), or it is the name of the color with the "cl" stripped off (Black). The `Style <Vcl.ExtCtrls.TCustomColorBox.Style.htm>`__ property determines which name is used for each color.

