    ParentColor: bool
    '''
    Specifies where a control looks for its color information. To have a control use the same color as its parent control, set `ParentColor <Vcl.Controls.TControl.ParentColor.htm>`__ to ``True``. If `ParentColor <Vcl.Controls.TControl.ParentColor.htm>`__ is ``False``, the control uses its own `Color <Vcl.Controls.TControl-Color.htm>`__ property.

