    ShowHint: bool
    '''
    Determines whether *Help Hints* are enabled or disabled for the entire application.

    Use ``ShowHint`` to choose whether to display *Help Hints*. If ``ShowHint`` is ``True``, *Help Hints* are enabled; if ``ShowHint`` is ``False``, *Help Hints* are disabled. The default value is ``True``. *Help Hints* are specified in the `Hint <Vcl.Forms.TApplication.Hint.htm>`__ property.

    Setting ``ShowHint`` for the application to ``False`` disables all *Help Hints*, regardless of the value of the `ShowHint <Vcl.Controls.TControl.ShowHint.htm>`__ properties for individual controls.

    .. tip:: You can customize the hint window by creating a custom descendant of `HintWindow <Vcl.Controls.THintWindow.htm>`__ and assigning it to the `HintWindowClass <Vcl.Forms.HintWindowClass.htm>`__ global variable.
