    .. note:: When writing a DLL that uses VCL forms, assign the window handle of the host EXE's main window to the ``Handle`` property of the DLL's global `Application <Vcl.Forms.Application.htm>`__ variable. This makes the DLL's form part of the host application. Never assign to the ``Handle`` property in an *EXE*.
