        Call ``UseRightToLeftScrollBar()`` to determine whether the vertical ``ScrollBar``\ s appear on the left sides of the application's controls. When ``UseRightToLeftScrollBar()`` returns ``True``, the vertical ``ScrollBar``\ s appear on the left sides of the controls. When ``UseRightToLeftScrollBar()`` returns ``False``, the vertical ``ScrollBar``\ s appear on the right.

        ``UseRightToLeftScrollBar()`` returns ``True`` for *Middle Eastern* locales if `BiDiMode <Vcl.Forms.TApplication.BiDiMode.htm>`__ is bdRightToLeft or bdRightToLeftNoAlign.
        '''
