    When the user types one of the key combinations listed in `SecondaryShortCuts <System.Actions.TContainedAction.SecondaryShortCuts.htm>`__, the ``Action``\ s. `Execute <System.Classes.TBasicAction.Execute.htm>`__ method is called.
