    '''
    BOF: bool
    '''
    Indicates whether the bind source adapter is positioned in the first record.

    Read ``BOF`` (beginning of file) to determine if `ItemIndex <Data.Bind.ObjectScope.TBaseObjectBindSource.ItemIndex.htm>`__ is located in the first record. If ``BOF`` is ``True``, the bind source has an adapter and the active record is the first one. ``BOF`` is also ``True`` if there is no active record. ``BOF`` is ``False`` in all other cases.
    '''
