    Use the `DragCursor <Vcl.Controls.TControl.DragCursor.htm>`__ property to change the cursor image presented when the control is being dragged.

    .. note:: To make a custom cursor available for the `DragCursor <Vcl.Controls.TControl.DragCursor.htm>`__ property, see the `Cursor <Vcl.Controls.TControl.Cursor.htm>`__ property.
    '''
    DragKind: DragKind
    '''
