    ImageName: ImageName
    '''
    Displays the name of linked items from the `Image Collection <Vcl.VirtualImage.TCustomVirtualImage.ImageCollection.htm>`__.
    '''
    ImageMargins: ImageMargins
    '''
    Margins of image on button.

    A ``Button``  be positioned using margins. `ImageMargins <Vcl.StdCtrls.TCustomButton.ImageMargins.htm>`__ holds a\ `ImageMargins <Vcl.StdCtrls.TImageMargins.htm>`__ object containing the margins of an image on a ``Button``. The `ImageMargins <Vcl.StdCtrls.TImageMargins.htm>`__. `OnChange <Vcl.StdCtrls.TImageMargins.OnChange.htm>`__ event is triggered when a margin changes.
