    .. note:: Controls that display text use either the `Caption <Vcl.Controls.TControl.Caption.htm>`__ property or the `Text <Vcl.Controls.TControl.Text.htm>`__ property to specify the text value. Which property is used depends on the type of control. In general, `Caption <Vcl.Controls.TControl.Caption.htm>`__ is used for text that appears as a window title or ``Label``, while `Text <Vcl.Controls.TControl.Text.htm>`__ is used for text that appears as the content of a control.
    '''
