    '''
    Specifies the text that is displayed as a text watermark in the ``Edit`` box of the ``ComboBox`` control.

    Use `TextHint <Vcl.StdCtrls.TCustomComboBox.TextHint.htm>`__ to ``get`` or ``set`` the watermark text that is shown in the ``Edit`` box of the ``ComboBox`` control.

    The disabled watermark is displayed as long as you do not modify the `Text <Vcl.Controls.TControl.Text.htm>`__ property of the ``ComboBox``.

    .. note:: This feature is only available for *Vista*, *Windows 7*, or later *Windows* operating systems.
    '''
