    Most applications should use the `ManualDock <Vcl.Controls.TControl.ManualDock.htm>`__ method rather than setting ``HostDockSite``. Setting ``HostDockSite`` automatically undocks the control from its previous host (if any) and docks it to the specified control, but does not adjust the control's position and alignment and bypasses the standard docking events.

