        As implemented in `Control <Vcl.Controls.TControl.htm>`__, ``AssignTo()`` checks whether the ``Dest`` parameter is a ``CustomAction`` object, and if so, assigns values to its `Enabled <Vcl.Controls.TControl.Enabled.htm>`__, `Hint <Vcl.Controls.TControl.Hint.htm>`__, `Caption <Vcl.Controls.TControl.Caption.htm>`__, and `Visible <Vcl.Controls.TControl.Visible.htm>`__ properties and its ``OnExecute`` event. This allows arbitrary controls to assign these to an associated ``Action`` object.
