        As implemented in `Control <Vcl.Controls.TControl.htm>`__, ``BeginAutoDrag()`` calls `BeginDrag <Vcl.Controls.TControl.BeginDrag.htm>`__, passing in the global `Mouse <Vcl.Controls.Mouse.htm>`__ variable's `DragImmediate <Vcl.Controls.TMouse.DragImmediate.htm>`__ and `DragThreshold <Vcl.Controls.TMouse.DragThreshold.htm>`__ properties.
