        .. warning:: `Loaded <System.Classes.TComponent.Loaded.htm>`__ may be called multiple times on inherited forms. It is called every time a level of inheritance is streamed in. Do not allocate memory in an overridden `Loaded <System.Classes.TComponent.Loaded.htm>`__ method without first checking that the memory has not been allocated in a previous call.
        '''
    def Create(self, AOwner: Component) -> None:
        '''
