        ``MouseUp()`` finishes a move or resize operation on a row or column, or if the user is selecting a range of cells using the mouse, ``MouseUp()`` finishes the select operation. Finally, ``MouseUp()`` generates an `OnMouseUp <Vcl.Controls.TControl.OnMouseUp.htm>`__ event.
        '''
