    Set ``TabHeight`` to control the height of the tabs that appear above the client region of the ``TabControl``. The ``TabHeight`` property is the vertical size in pixels of the individual tabs. If ``TabHeight`` is set to 0, the tabs automatically size themselves to fit their text.
    '''
    TabIndex: int
