    Contains the list of text strings that label the tabs of the ``TabControl``.

    ``Tabs`` contains a `Strings <System.Classes.TStrings.htm>`__, a list of strings that label the tabs in the ``TabControl``. To add new tabs to the ``TabControl`` or to edit the tabs themselves, add a new string or edit the strings currently in the ``Tabs`` property. (To open the `String List editor <String_List_editor.htm>`__, double-click the ``Tabs`` property in the `Object Inspector <Object_Inspector.htm>`__.) To rearrange the tabs, rearrange the list of strings.

    ``Tabs`` can also contain objects associated with the ``Label``s, using the `System.Classes.TStrings.Objects <System.Classes.TStrings.Objects.htm>`__ property.
    '''
