        As an optional parameter, you can specify `Encoding <System.SysUtils.TEncoding.htm>`__, which defines the encoding of the resulting file. If no encoding is specified, the default system encoding is used.

        .. note:: ``TreeView`` files contain only the text of the ``TreeView`` nodes. They do not contain any data associated with the nodes.
