        You can specify a `Encoding <System.SysUtils.TEncoding.htm>`__ parameter, which defines the encoding of the resulting stream. If no encoding is specified, the default system encoding is used.

        the format for ``TreeView`` data used by the ``SaveToStream()`` and `LoadFromStream <Vcl.ComCtrls.TCustomTreeView.LoadFromStream.htm>`__ methods lists the ``Text`` property for each node. Data associated with the nodes is not saved or loaded.
