        ``OnAdvancedCustomDrawItem`` is an event handler of type `Vcl.ComCtrls.TTVAdvancedCustomDrawItemEvent <Vcl.ComCtrls.TTVAdvancedCustomDrawItemEvent.htm>`__.
        '''
