    Indicates the time entered by the user.

    ``Time`` represents the time entered by the user. Set ``Time`` in program code or in the *Object Inspector* to determine which time is selected by default. (Applies only when `Kind <Vcl.ComCtrls.TDateTimePicker.Kind.htm>`__ = ``dtkTime``.)
