    If ``DateMode`` is ``dmComboBox``, the component has a drop-down calendar illustration from which the user can select a date. If ``DateMode`` is ``dmUpDown``, the component has Up/Down arrows with which the user can adjust the date. (Applies only when `Kind <Vcl.ComCtrls.TDateTimePicker.Kind.htm>`__ is ``dtkDate``.)
