    .. note:: If all the cells in the grid fit in the ``ClientWidth``, no horizontal ``ScrollBar`` appears, even if `ScrollBars <Vcl.Grids.TCustomGrid.ScrollBars.htm>`__ is ``ssHorizontal`` or ``ssBoth``. If all the cells fit in the ``ClientHeight``, no vertical ``ScrollBar`` appears, even if `ScrollBars <Vcl.Grids.TCustomGrid.ScrollBars.htm>`__ is ``ssVertical`` or ``ssBoth``.
