    ``GroupBox`` represents a *Windows* ``GroupBox``.

    The ``GroupBox`` component represents a standard *Windows* ``GroupBox``, used to group related controls on a form. When another control component is placed within a ``GroupBox``, the ``GroupBox`` becomes the parent of that component.
