    @classmethod
    def MethodAddress(self, Name: str) -> Pointer: ...
    @classmethod
    def MethodName(self, Address: Pointer) -> str:
        '''
        Returns the name of a class method by address.

        There are situations when it is useful to invoke an object method without hard coding the method name in advance. Call `MethodAddress <System.TObject.MethodAddress.htm>`__ to dynamically retrieve the address of such a method by specifying the method name as a string.

