        .. code-block:: python

           A.Assign(B); {Delphi}

        .. code-block:: python

           A->Assign(B); // C++

        if A knows how to handle B, then it does so and returns. If A doesn't know how to handle B's type, execution will trickle to the `Persistent <System.Classes.TPersistent.htm>`__ version of `Assign <System.Classes.TPersistent.Assign.htm>`__, which calls:

        .. code-block:: python

           B.AssignTo(A); {Delphi}

        .. code-block:: python

           B->AssignTo(A); // C++

        If B knows how to copy to A, the assignment succeeds. Otherwise, `Persistent <System.Classes.TPersistent.htm>`__ raises an exception.
        '''
