    `Images <Vcl.Menus.TMenu.Images.htm>`__ in the list should be 16x16.

    .. tip:: If the application uses ``ActionList``s, this property should be the value of the ``ActionList``\ s. `Images <Vcl.Menus.TMenu.Images.htm>`__ property. This way, ``MenuItems`` and buttons that do the same thing can display the same image.
