        Use the ``SetParams()`` method to set the `Position <Vcl.StdCtrls.TScrollBar.Position.htm>`__, `Min <Vcl.StdCtrls.TScrollBar.Min.htm>`__, and `Max <Vcl.StdCtrls.TScrollBar.Max.htm>`__ property values all at once, preventing repaints that would occur if each property value were set separately.
