    | *Disabled*       | This image usually appears dimmed to indicate that the button cannot be selected.                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
    +------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
