    -  `FileStream <System.Classes.TFileStream.htm>`__ -- for working with files.
    -  `StringStream <System.Classes.TStringStream.htm>`__ -- for manipulating in-memory strings.
    -  `MemoryStream <System.Classes.TMemoryStream.htm>`__ -- for working with a memory buffer.
    -  `WinSocketStream <System.Win.ScktComp.TWinSocketStream.htm>`__ -- for reading and writing over a socket connection.
