    ``Vcl.ComCtrls.TTabSheet.ParentDoubleBuffered`` inherits from `Vcl.Controls.TWinControl.ParentDoubleBuffered <Vcl.Controls.TWinControl.ParentDoubleBuffered.htm>`__. All content below this line refers to `Vcl.Controls.TWinControl.ParentDoubleBuffered <Vcl.Controls.TWinControl.ParentDoubleBuffered.htm>`__.

