    ================== ===========================================================================================================
    **Value**          **Meaning**
    ================== ===========================================================================================================
    ``tmBottomRight``  Tick marks are on the bottom or right of the ``TrackBar``, depending of the value of ``Orientation``.
    ``tmTopLeft``      Tick marks are on the top or left of the ``TrackBar``, depending of the value of ``Orientation``.
    ``tmBoth``         Tick marks are on both sides of the ``TrackBar``.
    ================== ===========================================================================================================

    If the ``TickStyle`` property is ``tsNone``, the value of ``TickMarks`` is ignored.
